      "description": "getImageData converts pixels into the requested predefined space: sRGB red #ff0000 on an srgb canvas, read back with { colorSpace: 'display-p3' }, returns an ImageData tagged display-p3 whose red channel is below 255 and green channel above 0 (the CSS-defined gamut mapping).",
      "kind": "script",
